 a list of emergency contacts.\n  - Keeping a record of incidents (dates, times, what happened).\n- **Avoid isolation**. Stay connected with trusted friends, family, or support groups.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Seek Professional Support**\n- **Therapy** can be", "decode_seconds": 4.942145731300116, "draft_calls": 137, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 296, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "45501dcf17b0374e7bce878745bc1446ea7146ca94b9241978aac163642cf1f5", "method": "relay_math_seed1730", "output_hash": "4e3093f4a04c01d2fe20b5ef03ce7af2675e0a72201266d6cb71301bd953ebf5", "output_tokens": 256, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 18768883200, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 19019071488, "problem_id": "mtbench/13/turn1", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 724.0880603790283, "prefill_full_target": 42.80147171020508, "prefill_relay": 0.14560000598430634, "relay": 28.554976046085358, "unattributed_runtime": 56.555982645601034, "verification_full_target": 4134.760604858398}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": null, "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 4.9869066956453025, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 19019071488, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 19019071488, "target_calls": 137, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.04299331968650222, "turn_index": 1}
